  annotation = {中文辅助译名：基于免疫的Web发现方法},
  abstract = {In order to improve the precision of Web discovery,a method named IWD(immunity-based Web discovery) for Web discovery is proposed.Mathematical formulas of self,non-self,antibody and antigen for Web discovery are established,and implementation of the method is described.The compared experimental results show that IWD has the ability of self-learning,higher precision and better time efficiency than the technique based on neural network does.},
